// Bitbucket User Login Failure Via SSH | T1021.004, T1110 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/application/bitbucket/audit/bitbucket_audit_user_login_failure_via_ssh_detected.yml
auditType.category:Authentication AND auditType.action:"User login failed\(SSH\)"

// Stellar Cyber Query Builder (DSL):
{
  "query": {
    "bool": {
      "must": [
        {
          "query_string": {
            "query": "auditType.category:Authentication AND auditType.action:\"User login failed\\(SSH\\)\"",
            "analyze_wildcard": true
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
